    "notes": [
      "Realized variance is measured on Binance BTC/USDT spot 1h closes. Twelve bars inside this window are not Binance data: they are Coinbase BTC/USD candles spliced in by carry_measure under the human-approved 2026-07-16 resolution of a real exchange-side gap (2021-04-20, 2021-04-25, 2021-08-13, 2021-09-29, 2023-03-24). Each splice boundary creates an artificial cross-exchange price step, so log returns straddling a boundary are excluded from the sum of squares and each window divides by its actual usable return count. Returns interior to a spliced run are kept. Nothing is interpolated (SPEC section 3.3)."
